      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm looking to overhaul our current operational structure. We have a lot of repetitive administrative tasks that are eating up our margins. How can I best use AI to optimize our workforce and reduce overhead costs without causing way too much employee turnover? I want to core happy but the",
